    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Today, we can make friends not only face-to-face, but also online. Do you think teenagers should make more friends on the internet? Here are some pros and cons of having online friends."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h1",
        "type": "heading",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Pros"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "l1",
        "type": "list",
        "items": [
          [
            {
              "t": "blank",
              "id": "b1",
              "number": 1
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " If you like movies, for example, you can join an online group of movie lovers and meet new people."
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "On the internet, it’s easier for shy people to start a conversation with a "
            },
            {
              "t": "vocab",
              "v": "stranger",
              "ref": "v-stranger"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": ". "
            },
            {
              "t": "blank",
              "id": "b2",
              "number": 2
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "You don’t have to go to the movies or go out to eat with your online friends. You can just "
            },
            {
              "t": "vocab",
              "v": "relax",
              "ref": "v-relax"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " at home and talk to them."
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "blank",
              "id": "b3",
              "number": 3
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " You can learn about each other’s culture."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h2",
        "type": "heading",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Cons"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "l2",
        "type": "list",
        "items": [
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "When you chat with your online friends, you have no way of knowing certain things. These include their "
            },
            {
              "t": "vocab",
              "v": "body language",
              "ref": "v-body-language"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " and their "
            },
            {
              "t": "vocab",
              "v": "tone",
              "ref": "v-tone"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " of voice. "
            },
            {
              "t": "blank",
              "id": "b4",
              "number": 4
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "An online friend may lie to you. It can be very dangerous to meet your online friends "
            },
            {
              "t": "vocab",
              "v": "in real life",
              "ref": "v-in-real-life"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": ". As a teenager, you should be careful when making online friends."
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Your online friends may disappear. "
            },
            {
              "t": "blank",
              "id": "b5",
              "number": 5
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " If you argue with them, they may hit the “"
            },
            {
              "t": "vocab",
              "v": "delete",
              "ref": "v-delete"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " friend” button when they get angry. In these cases, it will become difficult for you to reach them."
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "instruction": "Fill in each blank in the article with a proper sentence given below. Each sentence can be used only once. Note that there are two more sentences than you will need.",
      "bank": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Even your best friend may get mad at you sometimes."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "You can take your time to write and send your first message."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "They may stop using their social media account, for example."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "I should try to talk with my friends when a problem comes up."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "You can make friends online with people who share your interests."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "F",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "As a result, you may misunderstand the meaning behind their messages."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "G",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Making online friends from different countries can be a good experience."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
